  Sentences:
  - Text: ...................................
    emotion: 6
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: ARE YOU F*CKING KIDDING?!?! THERE'S NO RICHES?!?!
    emotion: 3
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: I DID ALL OF THAT FOR NOTHING????????
    emotion: 3
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: .................................
    emotion: 6
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: Well, I guess I did have fun along the way, and the triplets were fun.
    emotion: 0
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: Still, a reward would've been nice.
    emotion: 6
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: Whatever, I'm going home. I've been here all day.
    emotion: 0
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: The numbers sure were lucky.
    emotion: 1
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
